window.products.push({"id":1068243,"name":"howbonwe 8oz Glass Oil Vinegar Dispenser Set (set of 2), Clear Olive Oil Cruet for Kitchen No Drip Auto Flip Glass Cooking Oil Container Jar with Stai","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V-Y8UbIvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CRYSTAL GLASS OIL DISPENSER BOTTLE: In this package, you will get 2 pcs 8oz/250ml salad dressing cruet of 0.95lb weight for oil and vinegar; 3 pcs oil pouring spouts the other one as a spare; 4 pcs labels can distinguish which liquids it's holding; 1 pc stainless steel funnel helps fill oil easily without leakage. PREMIUM MATERIAL: Different from other ordinary fragile glass bottles on the market, our olive oil dispenser is made of high-quality crystal glass with thickened bottle bottom, which is heavier and more sturdy and durable, transparent, and textured than other oil dispensers of the same capacity. Perfect for use with olive oil, vinegar, soy sauce, cooking wine, etc. PRECISE OIL CONTROL: Oil dispenser bottle for the kitchen has an anti-drip design that keeps the olive oil cruet and kitchen clean. The transparent glass oil bottle lets you easy to see how much oil is left and better precise oil control during cooking, which make you have a healthy life. UNIQUE DESIGN: The stainless steel oil pouring spout of our oil dispenser is designed to flip automatically, the lid opens when the bottle is tilted and closes automatically when the bottle is upright. Compared with the oil push spout, our design reduces drips and oil spills, saves the trouble of extra cleaning, and keeps cooking less busy. Besides, thickened screw bottom design makes the bottle not easy to break and stable. KITCHEN HELPER: Our glass oil and vinegar dispenser set not only helps you control the use of oil having a low-fat healthy life but is also as a good helper for decoration, making the kitchen counter more simple and elegant. If you have any questions about our olive oil dispenser set, pls contact us via e-mail, we will help you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V-Y8UbIvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"howbonwe","source_asin":"B0BDFC12ZC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1068243","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDFC12ZC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDFC12ZC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
