window.products.push({"id":1068245,"name":"Luvle 20 oz Stainless Steel Tumbler double-Wall tumbler Vacuum Insulated Tumbler cups with Lids and Straws for COLD and HOT Beverage. Insulated coffee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RL6qXbAOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introducing Luvle 20 oz Tumbler Double-wall tumbler, insulated cup, stainless steel mug, shatterproof with a splash-proof lid, 2 straws, and 2 cleaning brush for all your hot or cold beverage. Made from the highest quality 18/304 food-grade stainless steel non-toxic, no smell protects your health. 18/8 stainless steel double-wall vacuum insulation technology, can maintain the temperature of hot coffee for 6 hours and keep ice over 24 hours. Wide mouth tumbler in multiple colors. Suitable for all occasions, indoors, home, office or school, outdoors, camping, hiking, picnics, beach, park. Pour water, milk, wine, juice, smoothie, champagne, cocktails keeps it cold. Keeps hot coffee, hot tea, hot chocolate, hot milk, hot toddy, and all other hot drinks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RL6qXbAOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luvle","source_asin":"B07YTKYBWY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1068245","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YTKYBWY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YTKYBWY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1068246,"name":"Furniture of America Traditional Style 4-Piece Antique Tobacco Oak Bedroom Set Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pMjl0XVYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This traditionally styled four-piece bedroom set is richly designed with intricate detailing. Each piece of this four-piece bedroom set boasts carved bun feet and a rich antique tobacco oak finish. The stately paneled platform bed, nightstand and mirrored dresser are crafted of quality materials and solid woods to ensure years of function and beauty.Set includes: One (1) bed, one (1) dresser, one (1) mirror and one (1) nightstandBed size options: Cal king, eastern king, queenMaterials: Solid wood, wood veneers, metal, felt, glassFinish: Antique tobacco oakMulti-colored panel design instills a sense of wonder without straying from the antique colorNightstand offers a total of three (3) drawers for bedside necessitiesTop drawer features double drawer design and added value with felt-liningDresser provides eight (8) drawers, each with a double drawer designExpansive beveled mirror arches beautifully while framed within a luxurious casingMajestic and intricate carvings found all along the bedAll dimensions are approximateMirror: 40.5 inches high x 53.5 inches wide x 3.5 inches deepDresser: 36 inches high x 68 inches wide x 22 inches deepNightstand: 32 inches high x 34 inches wide x 19.75 inches deepCal king: 70 inches high x 82.5 inches wide x 90.75 inches deepEastern king: 70 inches high x 86.5 inches wide x 86.75 inches deepQueen: 70 inches high x 70.5 inches wide x 86.75 inches deepAssembly required. This set ships in five (5) boxes.Mattress, box springs and bedding (comforters, sheets, pillows, etc.) are NOT included.Please note: Orders of 151-pounds or more will be shipped via Freight carrier and our Oversized Item Delivery/Return policy will apply. Please for more information.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pMjl0XVYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Furniture of America","source_asin":"B07558WWTG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1068246","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07558WWTG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07558WWTG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1068247,"name":"Private Listing for Lori-Cemetery Spring flowers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-M3sN+y0L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"We are happy to present this beautiful spring flower and greenery saddle for Spring 2016. This bright and full arrangement is built on a saddle with adjustable legs made to grip the grave marker securely. Each leg has an adjustable rubber covering to prevent scratching or discoloring the marker stone. The overall length of the arrangement is roughly 24 inches and the width is roughly 12-14 inches. The floral arrangement is approximately 12-14 inches tall (once placed on the marker). The saddle is made to fit almost any width of headstone. The legs of the saddle are very easy to bend but stiff enough to stay in place once you have fitted it to the marker. You will not be disappointed with the high quality silk flowers. The flowers are very vibrant and the greenery is full and lush. These daffodils, irises and roses are beautiful and we know you will love them. We think it will be a very popular choice for showing your loved ones that you will always remember them. Our cemetery flowers are made to last 3-4 months in the elements. We do recommend replacing them at least four times per year. That is why we offer the annual subscription rate of $159.95. When you select this option at checkout, you will receive four beautiful selections during the year shipped to the address you provide. The shipping dates and floral themes are shown below: December 1--Christmas theme that will go through Valentine's Day// March 1--Spring/early Summer theme that will go through May// June 1--Red/White/Blue theme for July 4th and Memorial day coverage// September 1--Fall/Thanksgiving theme","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-M3sN+y0L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Door and Decor, LLC","source_asin":"B01DKTV73G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1068247","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DKTV73G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DKTV73G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
