window.products.push({"id":1068318,"name":"(Upgradaed) AMIR Digital Alarm Clock, Table Clock with Backlight Snooze Function, Display Date Temperature & Humidity, Simple to Operate, Time Memory ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616oCBQm7+L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"FUNCTIONS： - Time in12/24H - Built-in Calendar and Weekday - Alarm with Snooze Function - Indoor temperature range :-10℃ to 50℃ - Indoor Humidity range: 10%RH-99%RH - Backlight - Power Cut Memory Function - Low Battery Indicato SNOOZE FUNCTION： 1. When the alarm sounds, press SNOOZE/LIGHT button to have 5 minutes’ snooze time. The alarm symbol will be flashing and the alarm will sound again in 5 minutes.The snooze function has no limit and will repeat infinitely. 2. When the alarm sounds, press any other button than SNOOZE/LIGHT button and ON/OFF button to stop the alarm. The alarm symbol will stay on the screen and the alarm will be activated again the next day. 3. To cancel the alarm, press the ON/OFF button. The alarm symbol will be disappeared. NOTE: 1. Never immerse the product in water .This will damage the product. 3. Do not subject the product to extreme force, shock, or fluctuations in temperature or humidity. 5. Do not mix new and old batteries or batteries of different types. 6. Do not mix alkaline, standard or rechargeable batteries with this product. 7. Remove the batteries if storing this product for a long period of time. Seller Warranty Policy: 45-Day Money Back Guarantee 12-Month Replacement Warranty 7/24 Online Customer Serivce Lifetime Support Guarantee","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616oCBQm7+L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMIR","source_asin":"B07RY6XR14","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1068318","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RY6XR14","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RY6XR14","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
