window.products.push({"id":1068363,"name":"Gadjit Exten Vac Vacuum Extension Attachment, 36\" Reach Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.11,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31oRjcnLsGL._AC_.jpg","description":"DEEP CLEANS HARD-TO-REACH AREAS: Ever wonder what's living and hiding under your fridge or furniture? Dust bunnies, crumbs & pet hair -- oh my! Let the long arm of Gadjit Exten Vac get rid of those hidden messes! The flat hose design allows easy access to those hard-to-reach places like under kitchen appliances or heavy furniture. Picks up crumbs between couch cushions or on stairs. With duel directional suction from the end and underneath, it sucks up the stuff in front and underneath it. ESSENTIAL TOOL IN HOME CLEANING: Gadjit Exten Vac Flat Vacuum Cleaner Attachment Hose Extender is a flat vacuum attachment that reaches areas like under the fridge, stove, vents, ducts, lint traps, corners to remove dust and dirt. It has a suction on the end AND the bottom of the attachment to capture anything that is in-front or under its path. An easy to use must have tool in home cleaning! WIDE RANGE & COMPATABILITY: Long, flexible, and sturdy the Exten Vac is perfect tool for any big or small cleaning projects. It adjusts to fit most vacuum cleaner hoses with an inner diameter of 1”, 1.2”, 1.3”, 1.4”, and provides up to a 36” reach. That's three extra feet of cleaning power! Get ready for your Fall and Spring cleaning with this handy and helpful Vacuum Cleaner Wand! DUAL DIRECTION SUCTION & EASY TO USE: The Extendable Under-Appliance and Furniture Vacuum Cleaner Attachment consists of two sturdy pieces of plastic that easily snap together and suction openings on the end and bottom to grab all the dust bunnies. To attach the Gadjit Exten Vac, just slide the graduating end of the Exten Vac into the end of your vacuum hose until it stops. MATERIAL & DIMENSIONS: Made of tough high-quality plastic, Gadjit Exten Vac is durable, safe, easy to clean and install. It is stiff enough that it does not collapse under vacuum but also flexes easily in any direction. <br> DIMENSIONS: 21\" x 3\" x 2\"; Weight: 4.8 OZ.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31oRjcnLsGL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gadjit","source_asin":"B00L5KMPCU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1068363","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00L5KMPCU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00L5KMPCU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
