window.products.push({"id":1068528,"name":"Glotoch Reusable Produce Bags 15 inch mesh Storage Bags Comes with Loop-Style Closures for Grocery Shopping & Storage of Fruit Vegetable seadfood & Ga","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-8Ix65rOL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Glotoch express，Make your time in the kichen easier,simpler and healthier. Glotoch 50Pcs 15\" Green Reusable Nylon Mesh Bags- Net Produce Bag-Grocery Toys Fruits Vegetables Drawstring Storage Poly Bags  Quantity: 50pack Color: Green MEASUREMENTS: The length of this mesh bags is 15\". Width of this product is 8\" flat, and stretches up to 14\". When fully stretched, the mesh holes measure expandable to approximately 1 sq. foot. Feature VARIETY USES AND REUSABLE Mesh bags offer an easy storage solution at street or farmers’ markets. They can easily be filled with items such as oranges, potatoes, apples, or onions. Pre-fill bags with vegetables, fruits, or nuts to a predetermined weight, and apply a set price per bag. These mesh bags are perfect for use at seafood and fish markets. They can be used to package mussels, clams, or other shellfish.  You can also use these bags tying up plant vines and stalks for hanging up growing fruit or vegetable that climb up fencing. It helps take the weight off the stems. Growing yield fruit in the air keeps predators from eating them and this green mesh bags makes this possible KEEP YOUR FOOD BREATHABILITY The mesh design of these bags means that they are completely breathable. This makes them ideal for storing items such as potatoes, onions, garlic, or citrus fruits. Allowing these food items to breathe prolongs their freshness and lifespan. Ensure your produce is fresh and at its prime. Seafood Boils Boiling or steaming large pots of seafood has never been easier than it is with the use of our mesh bags. The bag can be filled with shrimp, clams, mussels, crawfish, or other shellfish. Then, the whole bag can be lowered into the pot and left there throughout the cooking process.   These mesh bags are completely safe to use in boiling water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-8Ix65rOL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Glotoch Express","source_asin":"B01HT6OLXY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1068528","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HT6OLXY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HT6OLXY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
