window.products.push({"id":1068538,"name":"Hat Trick 6 in 1 Golf Divot Tool and Poker Chip Set, Ireland Logo, Kelly","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61M7Ou-2yZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The hat Trick 6-in-1 golf divot repair tool is a unique and multi-functional golf accessory. It incorporates a divot fixer, magnetic ball marker, bottle opener with a magnetic cap catcher which prevents the bottle cap from falling to the ground, a cigar holder, club rest, and can tab opener. The hat trick(r) 6-in-1 divot tool is a golf green friendly divot tool and comes in several different finishes. It is a must have for any golfer and can be used on the course or the 19th hole. This fun and quality golf accessory makes a Great gift for any golfer and is truly a keep sake. Hat Trick (R) golf accessories are all manufactured and assembled in the USA and is a veteran owed business. This unique gift set includes two ceramic Poker chips which are used for ball markers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61M7Ou-2yZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hat Trick Openers","source_asin":"B01HEBXALI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1068538","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HEBXALI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HEBXALI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1068539,"name":"N C Elegant Placemats for Dining Table Set of 4 Washable Woven Vinyl Placemat Non Slip Heat Resistant Kitchen Table Mats Easy to Clean Brown Large","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51H2cMfbxqS._AC_.jpg","description":"High-grade materials, non-polluting PVC materials are used for placemats. It is colorfast, easy to manage, and can be cut to any size you need. Used as coasters, thermos cups and hot pads on dining tables and coffee tables. The placemat can be rolled up or slid between items when cleaning the table, which is convenient for nursing. Our products will add an elegant experience to your life!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51H2cMfbxqS._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N\\C","source_asin":"B093ZVLCDF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1068539","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093ZVLCDF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093ZVLCDF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1068540,"name":"ChicWick Car Candle Leather Fiery Texas Shape Car Freshener Fragrance","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KJd46SPDL._SL1429_.jpg","description":"Get Your ChicWick On with our amazing car fresheners. Designed to hang from your car mirror, clothes closet, kitchen, multi-use, etc...... Scent will last several months. Loaded with the same scents that we have built our ChicWick brand on. Red Hot Cinnamon paired with our loyal Leather Country! This car candle is designed to withstand the summer time heat and will not melt hanging from your rear view mirror. Measures approximately 4 1/2 inches across and 4 3/4 inches down.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KJd46SPDL._SL1429_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ChicWick Candles","source_asin":"B06W9GRYXX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1068540","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06W9GRYXX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06W9GRYXX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1068541,"name":"Poundex Brown Finish W/Beige Fabric Counter Height Dining Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rrBJqceOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Poundex F2345 & F1205 counter height dining set has a traditional look with some modern flair. This dining set features a 42\" round table making it perfect for up to 4 guests. The table comes with a 18\" extension leaf for larger gatherings up to 6. The table top is crafted from solid wood and has a stunning dark brown finish. The dining chairs have solid wood frames with a matching dark brown finish. Each chair comes upholstered in a beige fabric with high density foam within. The backrests of the chair has low back look with a stylish sleek line design","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rrBJqceOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Poundex","source_asin":"B00OZ1NBGA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1068541","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OZ1NBGA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OZ1NBGA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1068542,"name":"Blendtec Designer Series, 9.25 x 15 x 7 inches, Cream","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MYmuz5fOL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Blendtec Designer Series Blender Blendtec is pleased to introduce the Designer Series blender. It has been engineered to bring a whole new level of beauty and functionality to the high-end blender category, without compromising the famous power and efficiency of our Total Blender Classic. ANATOMY OF BLENDTEC DESIGNER SERIES BLENDERS DURABILITY   •   PERFORMANCE DIRECT-DRIVE POWER That metal thing on your blender base that spins the blade? That’s a socket. Machined for a precision fit with the motor shaft, it efficiently transfers power to the blade. This steel-on-steel attachment results in lower vibration, reduced noise and increased reliability. THE RIGHT BEARINGS Many blenders avoid using ball bearings to drive down cost. Blendtec uses custom designed carbon-steel sealed ball bearings. This reduces friction, diminishes noise and increases the life of the motor. PERFORMANCE  •   DURABILITY COOLER HEADS PREVAIL Your Blendtec is engineered to keep itself cool. But in the unlikely event the motor does start to heat up too much, its computer brain will shut down the machine until it cools. Keeping it safe, sound and ready to blend your next masterpiece. SELF-ADJUSTING SPEED Certain ingredients blend better at slower speeds. A Blendtec blender carefully monitors and adjusts its power to deliver the speed you want. And if you manage to stop the blade, your Blendtec blender will shut down – protecting your valuable investment. DURABILITY   •   PERFORMANCE STAINLESS STEEL – THE PROFESSIONAL’S CHOICE Blendtec’s ultra-hard stainless steel blades are cold-forged and tuned for heavy use. is allows them to be stronger and resist corrosion much better than lesser blades. SINGLE BLADE, MANY ADVANTAGES Blendtec’s patented vertical wingtips and precision angles are engineered for ultimate efficiency. The distinct single-blade design allows your ingredients to fall easily in front of the blades. DURABILITY   •   SAFETY POWER FOR THE PEOPLE The most powerful motor available for home blenders is at the heart of your Blendtec experience. More power means easier blending of the most stubborn ingredients. SAFETY MATTERS Be assured that even a blender as powerful as a Blendtec blender is ETL certified, which means it meets national safety standards. DESIGN   •   SIMPLICITY TALK TO ME The digital display tells you just how long to wait until your blend is done. It also keeps track of your usage. As you reach 99…999…9,999 blend cycles and beyond, you’ll know that you chose the right blender! PERFORMANCE   •   DURABILITY   •   SAFETY NO DETAIL TOO SMALL Even the smallest parts in a Blendtec product have received big attention from our engineers. DESIGN   •   PERFORMANCE BETTER AIRFLOW, LONGER LIFE The blender housing creates the most efficient, effective airflow possible.* Drawing cool air first through the electronics and then through the motor, the airflow design keeps things cool and extends the life of your blender. STICK-TO-ITIVENESS A unique rubber foot* helps your blender stay put. It also prevents outgoing hot air from mixing with incoming cool air, further reducing operating temperature and increasing the life of your blender. SIMPLICITY KEEPING THINGS IN PLACE Every Blendtec jar features a square base that fits snugly over the square blending platform, creating a large stable base that prevents the jar from moving or rotating. All Blendtec consumer jars work perfectly with all Blendtec consumer blenders. Mix and match to your heart's desire! SIMPLICITY GET YOUR CONTROL FREAK ON A capacitive touch control* slider makes your blender perform to your every whim. A single touch shifts the motor to the precise speed you want.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MYmuz5fOL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blendtec","source_asin":"B008TWXOLS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1068542","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008TWXOLS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008TWXOLS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1068543,"name":"Neoflam Eela Frying Pan with Bakelite Handle and Ecolon Non-Stick Coating, 11-Inch, Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zAi33+xdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Eela, winner of the 2012 iF Product Design Award, possesses a graceful pleated wall, seamlessly-integrated handles, and stylized bakelite lid knob make it nothing short of functional artistry. Regarded as Neoflam's flagship cookware line, Eela is feature rich and extremely lightweight. Eela's cutting edge design and color make it the least boring piece of cookware in your arsenal. Eela's cast aluminum design provides multiple advantages over its competitors; known for its exceptional durability and high heat conductivity, cast aluminum is rising in popularity as a safe and affordable alternative to stainless steel. At just 1/3 the weight of cast iron, cast aluminum's even heat distribution properties allow for fast cooking and reduced energy consumption. Made in Korea. What is Ecolon™ coating? Ecolon™ by Neoflam is a professional grade non-stick, ceramic coating. Derived from the earth's minerals, Ecolon™ is PFOA free. Ecolon™ is applied to both the interior and exterior of the product, sustaining the product's durability while also facilitating convenience in cleaning. About Neoflam Neoflam is dedicated to bringing forth innovative kitchenware and household products that are healthy. Each product is engineered to have both exceptional design and performance; Neoflam's leadership in product design has been recognized by the following prestigious design awards: iF (2012), Red Dot (2012,2013,2014), and Design Plus (2014).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zAi33+xdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Neoflam","source_asin":"B00S6CV5X0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1068543","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00S6CV5X0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00S6CV5X0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
