window.products.push({"id":1068733,"name":"Hallmark Keepsake Christmas Ornament, I Am One! Baby's 1st Year Age Series","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81visqIMVeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Baby's first year is all about smiles, babbles, naps, giggles and a whole new world of love. Always remember this fun and adorable age with your baby’s very own Keepsake Ornament. They'll love the cute little panda design, and so will you! Festive and collectible, Hallmark Keepsake Ornaments come ready to give in a seasonal holiday gift box. The box can also be used for ornament storage. This Hallmark Keepsake Ornament measures 2.6 x 2.5 x 1.7 inches and comes in a 2.9 x 4 x 2.2 gift box. Ornament is made of plastic. Designed by Jake Angell. Each piece includes one I Am One! Baby's 1st Year Christmas Ornament in a gift-ready box. From preserving precious memories to commemorating special milestones, there's a Keepsake Ornament for everyone on your list. Hallmark has been your family-owned creator of greeting cards, gifts, gift wrap and more for over 100 years. We take deep pride in helping individuals connect in just the right way. This Hallmark original Keepsake Ornament features unparalleled artistry and exceptional detail. The ornament is lead-free and made for years of celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81visqIMVeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hallmark","source_asin":"B00WSR87WG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1068733","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00WSR87WG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00WSR87WG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
