window.products.push({"id":1068760,"name":"Mythological Egyptian Imsety Canopic Jar Statue Figurine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kCaQtXdKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Approx. 5\"H Imsety was a funerary deity. He was one of the four sons of Horus who were associated with canopic jars, but unlike his brothers who often were depicted with animal heads, Imsety has a human head. His jar contained the liver.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kCaQtXdKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Botega Distributing","source_asin":"B004709ALY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1068760","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004709ALY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004709ALY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1068761,"name":"40 Pcs Table Number Holders Place Card Holder, Name Cards Picture Holders for Tables Photo Menu Memo Clips Table Sign Stands Ideal for Wedding, Annive","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719HTkzgOFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Sturdy and Durable] Our table number holders are made of premium steel wire, which is sturdy, durable and can be reused over and over. The surface of this picture holder is plated so that it looks smooth and shiny. What's more, this name card holder won't break or fade because of its high quality material. When party is over, you can keep them well and reuse them next time. [Perfect Design] The wide spiral base of 1.57 inch diameter is sturdy enough that it can keep the place card holder steady and keep the clamped card upright and stable. It's suitable for indoor and outdoor, and will not tip over even though in breezy circumstance. The two circles clips at the top of the table card holder can hold your name card or table number firmly without falling down. The size is perfect to display the card's content clearly and it is suitable to hold standard-sized card. [Elegant Appearance] The two circular rings of the table number stands are classic and elegant, which can be incorporated into a wedding theme. The color of silver is simple yet elegant, perfectly matches any decor style and can not only add festive atmosphere but also create a romantic and unique sense of fashion. This picture holder stand looks small and cute, putting it on the desktop with beautiful card and flowers will add a sense of luxury to your table and impress your guests. [Multi-Function/Occasion] The elegant photo holder stand has many functions which brings lots of convenience to your life. It can be used as wedding name card holder, banquet table number clip, table menu rack, etc, helping guests navigate to their respective tables or related items easily; as well as used to write down unexpected office tasks, making the messy table top to be in order. This place card holder suits for wedding, anniversaries, birthday party, restaurant, home and office. [Packing List and After-Sale] The package comes with 40 pcs 3.3 inch tall table number holders and 20 pcs nanometre circle pasters, which are complimentary to be a gift. When you use these table sign holders outdoor in breezy days, you can attache the nanometre pasters to the holder's bases to make them stand more steadily on the table. If you have any problem, please don't hesitate to contact us, we'll solve the problem for you as soon as possible. Your satisfaction is our only pursuit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719HTkzgOFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"cyrico","source_asin":"B09B8YSSGR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1068761","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B8YSSGR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B8YSSGR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
