window.products.push({"id":1068763,"name":"Housewares Solutions Leak Proof Stainless Steel Compost Bin 1.3 Gallon – Includes 4 Extra Free Filters","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ji5lNyoGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DOUBLE FILTRATION SYSTEM EFFECTIVELY CONTROLS ODOR - In order to overcome the major drawback of notable stench when decomposing organics in your home, our compost bin has being designed in such a way that the airtight cover and double carbon filter keeps it spill proof and fight back against pungent odors. Even if some of your leftovers are already a few days old, you will hardly notice that they are there. STURDY LEAK PROOF STAINLESS STEEL CONSTRUCTION – Unlike plastic cans which cost much less than stainless steel, on average, but don’t hold up as long and don’t stand up to rough treatment as steel. Our beautiful stainless steel odor-trapping and leak-proof compost bin is also long lasting and easily turns food scraps into valuable nutrients for your plants. SPACE SAVING LARGE CAPACITY COMPOST PAIL - Want to make compost but don’t have enough space? No problem! Housewares Solutions compost bin fits on the counter, under the sink or in the pantry, and the large capacity can easily hold several one week' worth of organic waste. It provides a convenient solution for you if you don’t have enough space for a large pile. This is a great option for small kitchens to get in on the composting system. You don’t need a huge outdoor composter to reduce waste. EXTRR BONUS FREE FILTERS – Enjoy an entire year’s supply of charcoal filters. Your compost bucket comes with 2 dual filters already installed plus 4 extra free filters. These carbon filters will help to nicely absorb, neutralize and eliminate odors that could develop inside the pail. Depending on usage, we recommend you change your filters every 2 to 3 months by removing the old filter and putting the brand new one that comes with it. STYLISH ATTRACTIVE DESIGN MAKES THE CLEANING PROCESS SIMPLE – Specifically designed to maximize airflow so that scraps dry out faster, keeping nasty liquid from pooling up on the bottom. This means less clean up, less bad smells and less flies. It also looks attractive enough to make it an in-house accessory. Store wastes like egg shells, vegetable scraps in this budget friendly canister. Your garden will love the fresh nutrients that would have otherwise ended up as landfill.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ji5lNyoGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Housewares Solutions","source_asin":"B076JC3XQ9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1068763","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076JC3XQ9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076JC3XQ9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
