window.products.push({"id":1068772,"name":"SmartChoice Urn Keepsake for Ashes Cremation Urn Keepsake for Human Ashes - Affordable Funeral Keepsake Urn for Ashes Handcrafted Urn (Sky Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81s81l6yRyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Timeless, elegant and uniquely hand-crafted - it’s the keepsake urn your loved one deserves. Known as small urns, mini urns, sharing urns, or keepsake urns, these miniature urns are scaled-down versions of standard adult urns and go superbly with our matching full-sized adult cremation urns to honor their memory. This timeless Dove inspired design is suitable for the home or office, fitting in handsomely with your décor and is easily transportable. Just like those cherished memories, our high quality adult keepsake urn will last forever. That’s because it’s cast from premium quality , and hand crafted with a stunning, durable finish. This makes each of these keepsake urns for human ashes one of a kind, just like your loved one. These mini urns are durable, and have a good solid feel to them without being bulky. We’re proud to say that we think these are among the highest quality, most attractive small keepsake urns on the market, and best suited for your ash scattering service, mantel piece or other special location. They’re also a lovely choice to give away to children, grandchildren, relatives and friends. In fact, they’re the Smart Choice. Be sure to explore our storefront for other accessories such as medium and large adult urns, urn jewelry and necklaces, register guest books, and styles of urns for human remains, among other memorial and funeral supplies. As always, we present every product with a 100% Satisfaction Promise.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81s81l6yRyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SmartChoice","source_asin":"B07257SYCM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1068772","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07257SYCM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07257SYCM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
