window.products.push({"id":1068801,"name":"CafePress Golden Tote Bag Natural Canvas Tote Bag, Reusable Shopping Bag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31dU4jZ7y3L._AC_.jpg","description":"Your New Favorite Bag: Make a statement with a fun and functional canvas tote bag that shows off your unique personality. This versatile, multipurpose classic is sure to become your go-to reusable, foldable bag that is perfect for shopping, work, or vacation. Two Sizes: Small tote measures 15\" x 15 x 6\" with 26.5\" handles. Medium tote measures 15\" x 18\" x 6\" with 22\" handles. Each tote size features reinforced handles and full side and bottom support gussets for strength and durability. Professionally Printed: Our tote bags are imported from our trusted partners. Then each tote is expertly printed with sharp and vivid graphics using premium inks by our USA printing partner. Our quality totes are built to last: construction, design and graphic design placement. Easy To Care For Eco-Friendly Carryall Option: No need to use more plastic grocery bags, wasteful wrapping paper or other one time use products. Use for everyday errands, to present gifts, stow away items and organize with our minimalist tote bags. Once our cotton canvas bags become soiled, simply spot clean or place in washing machine on your favorite cold setting. Machine dry on low heat or hang dry. Ideal Everyday Tote or Gift : Treat yourself or surprise family members, friends, colleagues or your favorite teacher. Our beautifully designed cotton canvas tote bags make a unique and thoughtful present for Christmas, Easter, Mother's Day, birthdays, back-to-school, weddings, anniversary and so much more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31dU4jZ7y3L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CafePress","source_asin":"B0BHZ7NMD7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1068801","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHZ7NMD7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHZ7NMD7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1068802,"name":"G.a HOMEFAVOR Sprouting Kit for Wide Mouth Mason Jars, 6 Pack, Stainless Steel Strainer Screen for Canning Jars for Making Organic Sprout Seeds In You","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VyeetEyfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Description: These sprouting kits make it easy for making organic sprouting whenever you want. Fine mesh screen can avoid breaking seed buds when fresh water each time.   With the 6 pack sprouting lids, you can sprouting a varieties of seeds for each sprouting jar, keep a constant supply and meet the different tastes of your family. Specification: Material: 100% stainless steel Inner diameter: 72mm / 2.8in Outer diameter: 86mm / 3.4in Screen diameter: 82mm / 3.2in Bands height: 17mm / 0.67in Sprout Jar Sprouting Steps : 1. For a quart-sized jar, start with 1 1/2 table spoons seeds inside the jar, screw on the fine mesh sprouting lid and partially fill the jar with warm water, not hot.  2. Swirl it around to clean the seeds, then pour out. Refill with warm water to cover at about 16oz depth & let soak overnight, away from light. This gets the germination process started.  3. Pour off the soak water. Place drained jar propped at angles allow any extra water to drain out and not exposed to direct sunlight. Turn the jar to spread out the seed.  4. Cover the jar with the sprout jar lids and a dishtowel and leave for 3 to 4 hours. Rinse sprouts with cool, fresh water 2 or 3 times each day until they are ready to eat or refrigerate.  5. When they begin to throw off the seed hulls, let the jar with sprout jar lids installed overflow with the water and the hulls will float out the top through the sprouting lid screen. Turn the jar to spread out the seed each time you rinse.  6. Please Note: Special attention do not place them in salt water, and keep dry. Package Included: 6* Sprouting Jar Lids (Wide mouth Jars and seeds not included) Note: √Don't place sprouting lids in salt water.  √Keep sprouting lids dry and clean when not use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VyeetEyfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"G.a HOMEFAVOR","source_asin":"B07Q2BVHZX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1068802","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q2BVHZX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q2BVHZX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
