window.products.push({"id":1068903,"name":"Ohuhu Shoe Storage Box Clear Organizer XL Large Size Stackable Plastic Shoes Containers - Sneaker Closet Drawer Type Front Opening - 6 Pack Boot Bins ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wZ1yyelmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"6-PACK ULTRA LARGE SHOE BOX: If you need to keep your shoes safe, clean and organized, this shoe organizer is the perfect thing! Measuring 14.2'' (L) x 11'' (W) x 8.3'' (H), these shoe bins are large enough to store men's shoes up to size 14, high heels or sneakers boot for men and women. Keep your place tidy the way it should be. NOTE: The height of shoe cases is 8.26 inch, please kindly measure your shoes height before order in case of Not suitable. STURDY AND STACKABLE: Doesn't fold under pressure! Put this shoe plastic containers on top of another box, or other objects on top of it, rest assured the premium hard plastic and special snaps will keep everything strong and in place. BLACK TRANSLUCENT DESIGN: Worried about the colors fading or materials becoming damaged? Fear not, this translucent, stackable shoe display protects against exposure to sunlight. Plus, there are even ventilation holes to prevent odors from building up. If you're moving or need to store it, it can be packed flat, and also cleans easily! SIMPLE ASSEMBLY: Don't worry, anybody can set up this box with ease! It's as simple as a few quick steps and you're done! Open the door with one hand, grab your shoes and get out the door! MULTIFUNCTIONAL FOR VARIOUS USES: Chances are, if you need to store shoes, you might need to store other things, too. The possibilities are endless, from clothes, toys, documents, cosmetics, stationery, memorabilia, and more! Just stack them according to the dimensions of the space, whether that be in the closet, attic, under your bed or anywhere else that's convenient. Finally, you can be organized!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wZ1yyelmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ohuhu","source_asin":"B09W2LPCRX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1068903","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W2LPCRX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W2LPCRX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
