window.products.push({"id":1068908,"name":"Royal Albert Old Country Roses 20-Piece Dinnerware Set, Multi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":445.63,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FG7O4WQUL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The best-selling dinnerware pattern in the world, the Old Country Roses pattern is practically synonymous with the name Royal Albert and a long-standing testament to timeless style and elegant craftsmanship. This 20-Piece Place Setting includes everything needed for four guest's full dinner service; each setting consisting of a beautiful fine china dinner plate, salad plate, bread & butter plate, teacup and saucer; decorated with the Old Country Roses signature motif of burgundy, pink and yellow roses, accented with lustrous gold banding. Amazon.com Designed in 1962 by Harold Holdcroft, Royal Albert's Old Country Roses has become one of the most popular china patterns in the company's century-long history. The sumptuous design is enhanced by the elegant Montrose shape, graceful floral ornamentation, rich feminine colors, and a grace and elegance that is uniquely English. This dinnerware set is the perfect way to start off a collection that will last a lifetime and never go out of style. This 20-piece service for four includes four dinner plates, four salad plates, four bread and butter plates, and four teacups and saucers. Each dish is crafted from the finest bone china and has been richly adorned by hand with 22-carat gold. For best results, Royal Albert recommends washing by hand. --Lea Werbel What's in the Box 4 place settings. Each place setting consists of: 10-1/2-inch dinner plate; 8-inch salad plate; 6-1/4-inch bread and butter plate; 5-1/2-inch saucer; 6-1/2 ounce-teacup. 20 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FG7O4WQUL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Royal Albert","source_asin":"B08XPZCRD2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1068908","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XPZCRD2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XPZCRD2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1068909,"name":"Rae Dunn “Be You” Desk Plaque - Inspirational Message Desktop Sign for Home and Office Décor - Motivational Vintage Display for Cubicle, Work Space - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bplVFWicL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Desk Plaque by Rae Dunn features a daily encouraging and inspiring message, gracefully displayed in Rae Dunn's signature font. Solid galvanized metal with distressed wood adds a rustic and industrial note to any space. PLAQUES AVAILABLE \"Be You\" - 8 x 2.25 x 8 inches \"Create\" - 8 x 2 x 4 inches \"Draw\" - 6 x 2 x 4 inches \"Boss Lady\" - 11.75 x 2 x 4 inches \"Girl Power\" - 11.75 x 2 x 4 inches \"Girl Boss\" - 10 x 2 x 4 inches PRODUCT FEATURES: ✔ Motivational Message✔ Galvanized Metal and Distressed Wood✔ Display on Desktop, Shelf, Countertop, Mantle✔ Thoughtful Gift GET MOTIVATED IN STYLE Rae's unique combination of natural materials, industrial simplicity and personalization with her signature font create a fashionable platform for inspirational and reassuring messages. This desk plaque takes a simple message and breathes new life into it. Its minimalist aesthetic appeal looks great in any room. RAE DUNN California artist, ceramicist and author, Rae Dunn , finds beauty in simple shapes, imperfection and found objects. \"In my own way, I am driven to find the balance between expressing something that is deeply meaningful to me and creating a sense of joy that might quietly touch the lives of others.\" Rae's designs are known for their functionality, design and durability. Rae's signature font gives every item a personal touch and adds to the simple beauty of her designs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bplVFWicL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rae Dunn","source_asin":"B07WZPWD3K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1068909","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WZPWD3K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WZPWD3K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
